---
import Preview from '../Preview.astro';
---
<section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-[#e5dce7]" id="logistics">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">

<div class="lg:col-span-7">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-[#2563eb]">Logistics &amp; Hub Operations</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#231429] mb-4 tracking-tight">
            Coordinate receiving, sorting, and dispatch
          </h2>

<div class="bg-[#eff6ff] border border-[#bfdbfe] rounded-lg p-3.5 mb-6 flex items-start gap-2.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
<p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563eb]">Coordinate parcel receiving, sorting, and dispatch from a dedicated operations workspace.</p>
</div>
<p class="text-base text-[#594c5e] leading-relaxed mb-6">Logistics access requires Admin approval. Couriers require approval by their associated Logistics organization.</p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#bfdbfe] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#231429] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
                Parcel receiving
              </div>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e]">Receive and sort parcels.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#bfdbfe] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#231429] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
                Pickup and delivery planning
              </div>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e]">Plan pickup and delivery schedules.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#bfdbfe] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#231429] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
                Affiliated couriers
              </div>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e]">Coordinate approved affiliated couriers through the Rider mobile app.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-3.5 bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#bfdbfe] rounded-lg">
<div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#231429] mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                Courier approval
              </div>
<p class="text-xs text-[#594c5e]">Couriers use the Rider mobile app. Seller and Logistics workflows are available through their dedicated web portals.</p>
</div>
</div>
<a class="min-h-[44px] px-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#2563eb] hover:bg-[#1d4ed8] text-white text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#2563eb] focus-visible:outline-none" href="https://logistics.aisley.app" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
<span>Open logistics terminal</span>
<span class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
</a>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="bg-[#ffffff] border border-[#e5dce7] rounded-lg p-5 shadow-sm"><div class="text-xs text-[#594c5e] mb-4">Logistics dispatch workspace</div><Preview src="/screens/logistics.webp" title="Logistics dispatch workspace" width={780} height={437} /></div></div>
</div></section>
